---
// src/components/inbound/InboundMeetInsider.astro
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="bg-brand-50 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-brand-100 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row">
      
      <!-- Image Half -->
      <div class="md:w-5/12 lg:w-1/2 relative min-h-[300px] md:min-h-full bg-gray-200">
        <!-- Authentic Rice Tour guide & guests -->
        <img 
          src="https://media.thericetour.com/uploads/tour-group-listening-briefing-underground-hall-cu-chi-tunnels.webp" 
          alt="Hieu - Lead Travel Architect with guests at The Rice Tour" 
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[15%] hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-900/60 md:hidden to-transparent"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Half -->
      <div class="md:w-7/12 lg:w-1/2 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white text-brand-700 border border-brand-200 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 shadow-sm w-fit">
          Meet The Founder
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-snug">
          "Hi, I'm Hieu.<br />Welcome to my home."
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          <p>
            When I started <strong>The Rice Tour</strong>, I had one simple goal: to show you the Vietnam that locals know and love. Not the crowded tourist traps, and not the rushed 50-person bus tours where you barely have time to take a photo.
          </p>
          <p>
            I believe travel should be relaxing. That's why every trip we plan is 100% private. Whether you want to spend an extra hour sipping iced coffee in a hidden Saigon alley, or wake up late before exploring the Mekong Delta, it's completely up to you. You set the pace.
          </p>
          <p>
            I can't wait to show you around.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-sm shrink-0 bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center p-1.5">
            <img src="https://media.thericetour.com/uploads/logo-the-rice.webp" alt="The Rice Tour Emblem" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Hieu Huynh</div>
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 font-bold">Lead Destination Architect</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
